  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "gran On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum w\u00e6s an hirde on Ispanium, se w\u00e6s Ueriatus haten, & w\u00e6s micel \u00feeofmon, & on & on \u00f0\u00e6m reaflace he him geteah to micelne monfultum, & monege tunas oferhergeade. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m his weorod weox to \u00feon swi\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t he monega land forhergeade. & Romanum wear\u00f0 micel ege from him, & Uecilius \u00feone consul ongean hiene mid firde sendon, \u00c6t o\u00ferum cirre \u00feider for Gaius Folucius se consul, & eac gefliemed wear\u00f0. \u00c6t \u00feriddan cirre \u00feider for Claudius se consul, & \u00feohte \u00fe\u00e6t he Romana bismer gewrecan sceolde, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Ueriatus gemette mid \u00ferim hunde monna Romana an M on anum wuda. \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s Ueriatuses folces ofslagen LXX, & Romana CCC, & \u00fea o\u00fere gefliemde. On \u00fe\u00e6m fleame wear\u00f0 an Ueriatuses \u00feegn \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00ferum to longe \u00e6fterfylgende, o\u00fe mon his hors \u00dea woldon \u00fea o\u00fere ealle hiene \u00e6nne ofslean, o\u00fe\u00fee gebindan. \u00dea slog he anes monnes hors mid his sweorde \u00fe\u00e6t him wand \u00fe\u00e6t heafod of. Si\u00fe\u00fean w\u00e6s eallum \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00ferum swa micel ege from him \u00fe\u00e6t hi hiene leng gretan ne dorstan. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Apius Claudius se consul gefeaht wi\u00f0 G\u00e6lle, & \u00fe\u00e6r gefliemed wear\u00f0; & ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s eft \u00dea he hamweard w\u00e6s, \u00fea b\u00e6d he \u00fe\u00e6t mon dyde beforan him \u00feone triumphan. Ac him Romane untreowlice his forw",
